{"id":"907cbbf21e362abd","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-unit-normal.md","title":"Unit Normal","display":"df-unit-normal — Unit Normal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-unit-normal","aliases":["58-df-unit-normal","Unit Normal"],"display":"df-unit-normal — Unit Normal","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-unit-normal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-unit-normal</span><span>Unit Normal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unit-normal — Unit Normal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{n+1}\">\\(M\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\)</span> (smooth hypersurface), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in M\">\\(p\\in M\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_pM\">\\(T_pM\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_pM=(T_pM)^\\perp\">\\(N_pM=(T_pM)^\\perp\\)</span> (tangent and normal spaces)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\)</span> (candidate normal vector)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UnitNormalStructure}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\operatorname{UnitNormalStructure}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UnitNormal}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{UnitNormal}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unit\\text{-}normal\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\operatorname{UnitNormalStructure}_S(\\nu,p,M,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land M\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\land p\\in M\\land\\nu\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\land\\|\\nu\\|=1\\land\\forall v\\in T_pM\\;(\\nu\\cdot v=0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unit\\text{-}normal\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\operatorname{UnitNormalStructure}_S(\\nu,p,M,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land M\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\land p\\in M\\land\\nu\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\land\\|\\nu\\|=1\\land\\forall v\\in T_pM\\;(\\nu\\cdot v=0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unit\\text{-}normal} \\vdash \\operatorname{UnitNormal}_S(\\nu,p,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{UnitNormalStructure}_S(\\nu,p,M,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unit\\text{-}normal} \\vdash \\operatorname{UnitNormal}_S(\\nu,p,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{UnitNormalStructure}_S(\\nu,p,M,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Unit normal: a normalized ambient vector orthogonal to every tangent vector; the formerly free ambient dimension is now bound.</li>\n<li>Oriented hypersurface: choice of consistent unit normal field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{n}\">\\(\\mathbf{n}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Shape operator: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A = -d\\mathbf{n}: T_p M \\to T_p M\">\\(A = -d\\mathbf{n}: T_p M \\to T_p M\\)</span>, self-adjoint</li>\n<li>Principal curvatures: eigenvalues <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_1, \\ldots, \\kappa_n\">\\(\\kappa_1, \\ldots, \\kappa_n\\)</span> of shape operator</li>\n<li>Mean curvature: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum \\kappa_i\">\\(H = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum \\kappa_i\\)</span>; minimal surface: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H = 0\">\\(H = 0\\)</span></li>\n<li>Gaussian curvature: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K = \\prod \\kappa_i = \\det A\">\\(K = \\prod \\kappa_i = \\det A\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>do Carmo, Differential Geometry of Curves and Surfaces</li>\n<li>O'Neill, Elementary Differential Geometry</li>\n<li>Spivak, A Comprehensive Introduction to Differential Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"M\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"T_pM","display":false},{"tex":"N_pM=(T_pM)^\\perp","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UnitNormalStructure}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UnitNormal}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unit\\text{-}normal\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\operatorname{UnitNormalStructure}_S(\\nu,p,M,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land M\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\land p\\in M\\land\\nu\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\land\\|\\nu\\|=1\\land\\forall v\\in T_pM\\;(\\nu\\cdot v=0)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unit\\text{-}normal} \\vdash \\operatorname{UnitNormal}_S(\\nu,p,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{UnitNormalStructure}_S(\\nu,p,M,n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{n}","display":false},{"tex":"A = -d\\mathbf{n}: T_p M \\to T_p M","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_1, \\ldots, \\kappa_n","display":false},{"tex":"H = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum \\kappa_i","display":false},{"tex":"H = 0","display":false},{"tex":"K = \\prod \\kappa_i = \\det A","display":false}],"bytes":1759,"backlinks":[{"id":"1946c1e666e6036a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{UnitNormal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-unit-normal.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1351","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-unit-normal.md|58-df-unit-normal]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":[]}